(5148777, 748679, 88613, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the shadow! I did a very similar picture, I guess great minds think alike! My one suggestion would be to use a more appropriate book like a Bible with a verse about love or a poetry book rather than book of lodging...</td>', 'Nice job with the shadow! I did a very similar picture, I guess great minds think alike! My one suggestion would be to use a more appropriate book like a Bible with a verse about love or a poetry book rather than book of lodging...', '2008-12-24 00:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148779, 749270, 88613, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2008-12-24 00:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148781, 749114, 54446, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.  Very fine and elegant shadows.  Hope this ribbons, with a blue.  (10)</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.  Very fine and elegant shadows.  Hope this ribbons, with a blue.  (10)', '2008-12-24 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148784, 748521, 54446, '<td valign="top">One of the very top images in this challenge.  Great lines and impressive composition.  (9)</td>', 'One of the very top images in this challenge.  Great lines and impressive composition.  (9)', '2008-12-24 00:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148785, 749519, 88613, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure I used to have that toy when I was growing up. Isn''t that from "Alien"? Nice shadow!</td>', 'I''m pretty sure I used to have that toy when I was growing up. Isn''t that from "Alien"? Nice shadow!', '2008-12-24 00:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148787, 748626, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows.   A good concept, well seen and captured.  (9)</td>', 'Nice shadows.   A good concept, well seen and captured.  (9)', '2008-12-24 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148788, 748901, 88613, '<td valign="top">Great minds think alike! Nice heart!</td>', 'Great minds think alike! Nice heart!', '2008-12-24 00:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148789, 749610, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Accurate colorful light at sunrise.  Good sun star radians.  (8)</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Accurate colorful light at sunrise.  Good sun star radians.  (8)', '2008-12-24 00:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148794, 748658, 101117, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for my liking, I like the idea but there''s just too little visible.<br/> <br/>Perhaps if the light in the frame silouheted the figure more it would be better.</td>', 'A little too dark for my liking, I like the idea but there''s just too little visible. Perhaps if the light in the frame silouheted the figure more it would be better.', '2008-12-24 00:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148800, 749626, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice almost abstract shot. If it wasn''t for the title I wouldn''t actually know what it was.<br/> <br/>The shadows aren''t fully apparent, possibly because of the tightness of the shot. Perhaps if there was a little more empty space around the subject to bring out the shadows it would have looked better.</td>', 'This is a really nice almost abstract shot. If it wasn''t for the title I wouldn''t actually know what it was. The shadows aren''t fully apparent, possibly because of the tightness of the shot. Perhaps if there was a little more empty space around the subject to bring out the shadows it would have looked better.', '2008-12-24 00:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148818, 748862, 101117, '<td valign="top">While there is a shadow here, I don''t feel it actually adds to the shot at all.<br/> <br/>I realise there''s no way you could set a shot like this up,but  I think it would have worked better with the bird at the right side of the frame looking towards the shadow. Obviously that doesn''t help much but just my opinion :)</td>', 'While there is a shadow here, I don''t feel it actually adds to the shot at all. I realise there''s no way you could set a shot like this up,but  I think it would have worked better with the bird at the right side of the frame looking towards the shadow. Obviously that doesn''t help much but just my opinion :)', '2008-12-24 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148825, 748396, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the shadow is subtle but stands out. I do think the composition lets it down slightly, the shot seems to be skewed slightly to the left and the colours don''t seem to stand out particularly, and while I feel that was deliberate, I don''t think it''s an effect that works on something as bright and pretty as Christmas presents.</td>', 'Great idea, the shadow is subtle but stands out. I do think the composition lets it down slightly, the shot seems to be skewed slightly to the left and the colours don''t seem to stand out particularly, and while I feel that was deliberate, I don''t think it''s an effect that works on something as bright and pretty as Christmas presents.', '2008-12-24 00:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148831, 749238, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and subject, but it feels a little over sharpened. Also, the top half of the image feels a little crowded, not sure what in particular is causing this, perhaps the harsh highlights against the shadows, again, this could be a result of over sharpening, or too high contrast.</td>', 'Nice colours and subject, but it feels a little over sharpened. Also, the top half of the image feels a little crowded, not sure what in particular is causing this, perhaps the harsh highlights against the shadows, again, this could be a result of over sharpening, or too high contrast.', '2008-12-24 01:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148836, 748789, 101117, '<td valign="top">Like the long shadow and the angle makes it interesting, might have been nice though if the dog had a little more space to "walk into", that would give the title a little more emphasis, like the dog was heading somewhere.</td>', 'Like the long shadow and the angle makes it interesting, might have been nice though if the dog had a little more space to "walk into", that would give the title a little more emphasis, like the dog was heading somewhere.', '2008-12-24 01:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148841, 749148, 101117, '<td valign="top">I feel there''s a lack of solid subject here. Initially I''m drawn to the bright area to the left of the lamp post, then I find myself looking around the image eventually coming to rest with the car, which itself isn''t really a clear subject either.<br/> <br/>I think since the the subject is shadows, then to bring the lamp post into the shot a little more and deepen the shadows in PP would have helped.</td>', 'I feel there''s a lack of solid subject here. Initially I''m drawn to the bright area to the left of the lamp post, then I find myself looking around the image eventually coming to rest with the car, which itself isn''t really a clear subject either. I think since the the subject is shadows, then to bring the lamp post into the shot a little more and deepen the shadows in PP would have helped.', '2008-12-24 01:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148848, 748479, 101117, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the flash / light source has helped this image particularly, it has resulted in a single lit strip along what appears to be a very richly coloured candle. What might have helped here would be to use a long exposure with just a reflector or low level fill flash to bring out the candles colours.</td>', 'I don''t think the flash / light source has helped this image particularly, it has resulted in a single lit strip along what appears to be a very richly coloured candle. What might have helped here would be to use a long exposure with just a reflector or low level fill flash to bring out the candles colours.', '2008-12-24 01:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148858, 749259, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice peaceful image, great shadows on the building. Composition lets it down slightly, the window at the bottom of the image looks attractive, it could have been good to bring the shot down a bit and bring that in, while giving it a little less sky.</td>', 'Nice peaceful image, great shadows on the building. Composition lets it down slightly, the window at the bottom of the image looks attractive, it could have been good to bring the shot down a bit and bring that in, while giving it a little less sky.', '2008-12-24 01:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148863, 749618, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice picturesque clam scene. Like the fact that you''ve managed to capture some of the highlights and shadows in tricky lighting.</td>', 'Nice picturesque clam scene. Like the fact that you''ve managed to capture some of the highlights and shadows in tricky lighting.', '2008-12-24 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148873, 748380, 101117, '<td valign="top">Love the look. Good lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Love the look. Good lighting and DOF.', '2008-12-24 01:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148930, 749455, 85255, '<td valign="top">this shot is too ''posed'' and casual to the point of it being ''boring''.  include elements that would provoke and rouse the viewer''s curiosity.  shadows as a theme offers lots of opportunities for great shots.  don''t just settle for ''plain janes''.</td>', 'this shot is too ''posed'' and casual to the point of it being ''boring''.  include elements that would provoke and rouse the viewer''s curiosity.  shadows as a theme offers lots of opportunities for great shots.  don''t just settle for ''plain janes''.', '2008-12-24 02:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148937, 748862, 85255, '<td valign="top">a frontal shot of the pelican against the blue background could have been more interesting.  there is hardly any emphasis on the shadow, although that has been acknowledged in the title of this shot...</td>', 'a frontal shot of the pelican against the blue background could have been more interesting.  there is hardly any emphasis on the shadow, although that has been acknowledged in the title of this shot...', '2008-12-24 02:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148939, 749036, 85255, '<td valign="top">there''s hardly any shadow in this shot!!  could have worked better for this shot to increase the contrast to create the highlights and shadows on the terrain...</td>', 'there''s hardly any shadow in this shot!!  could have worked better for this shot to increase the contrast to create the highlights and shadows on the terrain...', '2008-12-24 02:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5148954, 749398, 85255, '<td valign="top">cool shot</td>', 'cool shot', '2008-12-24 02:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
