(5149012, 749651, 99506, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but I''m struggling to see the shadows</td>', 'Lovely shot but I''m struggling to see the shadows', '2008-12-24 04:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149013, 749259, 99506, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the crop on the left as it leads me out of the picture, also it would be better IMO if it was rotated slightly to be horizontal, but a nice overall shot. I like the subtle title.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the crop on the left as it leads me out of the picture, also it would be better IMO if it was rotated slightly to be horizontal, but a nice overall shot. I like the subtle title.', '2008-12-24 04:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149015, 749467, 99506, '<td valign="top">I think I can see the affect you were going for but personally I actually prefer it the other way up.</td>', 'I think I can see the affect you were going for but personally I actually prefer it the other way up.', '2008-12-24 04:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149017, 748396, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with a good feel to it. I would have rotated it so that the flu was vertical in the shot though.</td>', 'Nice idea with a good feel to it. I would have rotated it so that the flu was vertical in the shot though.', '2008-12-24 04:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149019, 749638, 99506, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Would have been more striking with lower lighting so we could see the detail on the razor blade.<br/>Is that sensor dust on the left or was it on the background? <br/>Nice shot by the way.</td>', 'I like the idea. Would have been more striking with lower lighting so we could see the detail on the razor blade.Is that sensor dust on the left or was it on the background? Nice shot by the way.', '2008-12-24 04:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149020, 749550, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice mood in this shot</td>', 'Nice mood in this shot', '2008-12-24 04:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149023, 749428, 99506, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here with the use of colours in the shadows.<br/>I dont know what ISO you shot this on but I think for this kind of lighting I would use a tripod, as low an ISO as you can get to avoid the noise, a highish F number for depth of field and a long exposure time.<br/>Also a piece of white card or paper curved against the wall so that we don''t see the line where the wall meets the floor.<br/>I sound really critical here for which I apologise but I hope it helps.</td>', 'I like the idea here with the use of colours in the shadows.I dont know what ISO you shot this on but I think for this kind of lighting I would use a tripod, as low an ISO as you can get to avoid the noise, a highish F number for depth of field and a long exposure time.Also a piece of white card or paper curved against the wall so that we don''t see the line where the wall meets the floor.I sound really critical here for which I apologise but I hope it helps.', '2008-12-24 04:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149025, 749282, 99506, '<td valign="top">Now I thought for a minute there you were a fan of Hitch Hikers Guide to the Galaxy but that would have ben 101010 eh lol.<br/>Great shot very well executed, I like the way the shadows run out of the frame.</td>', 'Now I thought for a minute there you were a fan of Hitch Hikers Guide to the Galaxy but that would have ben 101010 eh lol.Great shot very well executed, I like the way the shadows run out of the frame.', '2008-12-24 04:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
