(5149749, 749543, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh yea!  Great geometry here.  Terrific balance of solid shapes, both vertically and horizontally.  The people really add a third dimension to this.  Love it.  The bw really emphasizes the content.</td>', 'Oh yea!  Great geometry here.  Terrific balance of solid shapes, both vertically and horizontally.  The people really add a third dimension to this.  Love it.  The bw really emphasizes the content.', '2008-12-24 13:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
