(5149976, 748396, 76335, '<td valign="top">Are those stockings that are hanging? They need to be a bit more instantly recognizable as such, otherwise they''re a distraction. I had to look at this a while to identify them. That quibble aside, this is good, and the shadow of the child is perfect.</td>', 'Are those stockings that are hanging? They need to be a bit more instantly recognizable as such, otherwise they''re a distraction. I had to look at this a while to identify them. That quibble aside, this is good, and the shadow of the child is perfect.', '2008-12-24 17:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149978, 749399, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good study in shadows.</td>', 'A good study in shadows.', '2008-12-24 17:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5149984, 749457, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The color adds nothing to this shot though -- if anything, it''s a distraction. Try this as a high contrast black-and-white.</td>', 'I like the idea. The color adds nothing to this shot though -- if anything, it''s a distraction. Try this as a high contrast black-and-white.', '2008-12-24 17:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
