(5151499, 748927, 101117, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there''s much of real interest here. The scene in general is untidy because of the patchy snow and partial plant at the top, and the subject isn''t striking for any real reason.</td>', 'I don''t think there''s much of real interest here. The scene in general is untidy because of the patchy snow and partial plant at the top, and the subject isn''t striking for any real reason.', '2008-12-26 01:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151500, 749337, 101117, '<td valign="top">Like the idea here, more interesting than many of the entry''s in the challenge. For me though, the unfocused legs of the glasses are just in the way and don''t add anything. Perhaps a change of composition bringing the camera lower down and left a little so that the legs appear to "frame" the lens area would have helped.</td>', 'Like the idea here, more interesting than many of the entry''s in the challenge. For me though, the unfocused legs of the glasses are just in the way and don''t add anything. Perhaps a change of composition bringing the camera lower down and left a little so that the legs appear to "frame" the lens area would have helped.', '2008-12-26 01:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151502, 749234, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, little dark though. When shooting snow remember the camera will attempt to expose the snow as a grey colour so it''s always useful to add +1 stop to make up for it.</td>', 'Nice subject, little dark though. When shooting snow remember the camera will attempt to expose the snow as a grey colour so it''s always useful to add +1 stop to make up for it.', '2008-12-26 01:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
