(5151957, 749049, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting "specimen", but I feel that IT is the subject of this shot, and the shadow is incidental.</td>', 'Very interesting "specimen", but I feel that IT is the subject of this shot, and the shadow is incidental.', '2008-12-26 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151958, 748275, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  Shadow.  Not Reflection.</td>', 'Hmmmm.  Shadow.  Not Reflection.', '2008-12-26 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151959, 749247, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this isn''t working for me.  There is way too much contrast, so the delicate lines on the facade - which would make for great detail - are hard to see.  Also, I don''t feel it shows much of a "shadow", even though there are areas of darkness.</td>', 'Sorry, this isn''t working for me.  There is way too much contrast, so the delicate lines on the facade - which would make for great detail - are hard to see.  Also, I don''t feel it shows much of a "shadow", even though there are areas of darkness.', '2008-12-26 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151961, 749270, 96751, '<td valign="top">GREAT concept.  But the map doesn''t work; it''s too sketchy and blurred.  And the light is too blown out, making the glare from the white background drown out the color of the pins.  I think you missed an opportunity by placing the pin on our global "hot spots".</td>', 'GREAT concept.  But the map doesn''t work; it''s too sketchy and blurred.  And the light is too blown out, making the glare from the white background drown out the color of the pins.  I think you missed an opportunity by placing the pin on our global "hot spots".', '2008-12-26 12:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151962, 749549, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Needs better lighting.</td>', 'Great idea.  Needs better lighting.', '2008-12-26 12:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151964, 749626, 96751, '<td valign="top">This shot is for me equal parts light and shadow, instead of just Shadow.  And the "shadow" is more of a reflection.  Beautiful shapes and movement, but doesn''t quite fit the challenge for me.</td>', 'This shot is for me equal parts light and shadow, instead of just Shadow.  And the "shadow" is more of a reflection.  Beautiful shapes and movement, but doesn''t quite fit the challenge for me.', '2008-12-26 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151965, 749379, 96751, '<td valign="top">Although this is definitely a shadow, there is nothing focused in this shot.</td>', 'Although this is definitely a shadow, there is nothing focused in this shot.', '2008-12-26 12:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151966, 749316, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this!  Excellent colors, love the stars in the nubs, the shadow is so very prominent.  Great work.  To be nitpicky, the lighting is just a bit overblown on either side.  But really, the only thing keeping me for giving it a 10 is the proportion.  The elongated shadow above the vase gives it an odd vertical dimension to my (newbie) eyes which is unpleasant.</td>', 'I LOVE this!  Excellent colors, love the stars in the nubs, the shadow is so very prominent.  Great work.  To be nitpicky, the lighting is just a bit overblown on either side.  But really, the only thing keeping me for giving it a 10 is the proportion.  The elongated shadow above the vase gives it an odd vertical dimension to my (newbie) eyes which is unpleasant.', '2008-12-26 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5151970, 748069, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great lines and colors. Good negative space too.</td>', 'Great lines and colors. Good negative space too.', '2008-12-26 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152138, 749469, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice find - I like how the shadow completely changes the color and mood of each side.</td>', 'Nice find - I like how the shadow completely changes the color and mood of each side.', '2008-12-26 15:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152140, 748380, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good lookin'' guy - very proud, and perhaps just a touch haughty.  Nice spotlight/shadow approach.</td>', 'Good lookin'' guy - very proud, and perhaps just a touch haughty.  Nice spotlight/shadow approach.', '2008-12-26 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152143, 749393, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heck, I don''t know if I''m the Deb this is ode''d to, but damn it''s sweet!  I LOVE that the shadows are so light and delicate, then fade into gray on the curve.  And birds!  There are birds!  And it''s monochromatic.  Perfect.  Now I''m probably going to have to vote this challenge.</td>', 'Heck, I don''t know if I''m the Deb this is ode''d to, but damn it''s sweet!  I LOVE that the shadows are so light and delicate, then fade into gray on the curve.  And birds!  There are birds!  And it''s monochromatic.  Perfect.  Now I''m probably going to have to vote this challenge.', '2008-12-26 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152263, 749203, 101117, '<td valign="top">Amusing pic. I would say the framing is just a little off with the top corner of the holder being cut off.</td>', 'Amusing pic. I would say the framing is just a little off with the top corner of the holder being cut off.', '2008-12-26 18:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152264, 749036, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture of snow but I don''t see any real shadows in the whole shot.</td>', 'This is a nice picture of snow but I don''t see any real shadows in the whole shot.', '2008-12-26 18:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152271, 749630, 101117, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is a bit busy, the foreground tree and all the background trees blend together because of the similar texture and colours. Perhaps if you brought in a little more of the foreground and background and took the shot from a lower angle to make the backdrop of the tree the more distant hill it would have helped.</td>', 'I think this shot is a bit busy, the foreground tree and all the background trees blend together because of the similar texture and colours. Perhaps if you brought in a little more of the foreground and background and took the shot from a lower angle to make the backdrop of the tree the more distant hill it would have helped.', '2008-12-26 18:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152274, 748795, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, though it took me a few seconds to see it. Initially I only saw a side lit mug, it was only when I looked away and back again that I actually saw the heart. I think the only way you could make it more apparent is to deepen the shadow with a harder light, not sure what that would do to the shot though. <br/> <br/>Still, love the idea, 7 from me.</td>', 'This is a great idea, though it took me a few seconds to see it. Initially I only saw a side lit mug, it was only when I looked away and back again that I actually saw the heart. I think the only way you could make it more apparent is to deepen the shadow with a harder light, not sure what that would do to the shot though.  Still, love the idea, 7 from me.', '2008-12-26 18:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152275, 748962, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, love the light and shadows. Initially I thought it was a barren landscape shot from a distance until I read the title. 7</td>', 'Very nice image, love the light and shadows. Initially I thought it was a barren landscape shot from a distance until I read the title. 7', '2008-12-26 18:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152276, 749433, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene, great light and shadows.</td>', 'Very nice scene, great light and shadows.', '2008-12-26 18:06:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5152277, 749398, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, works well in B&amp;W. I think the only thing I might have changed would have the model either look straight forward or sideways towards the camera to get more out of her eyes. Apart from that, good shot. 7</td>', 'Very nice portrait, works well in B&W. I think the only thing I might have changed would have the model either look straight forward or sideways towards the camera to get more out of her eyes. Apart from that, good shot. 7', '2008-12-26 18:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152278, 749396, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, one of the better ones I''ve seen so far. The only change I might have made is move just a touch to the right before taking this so that the shadow runs from the left side giving a nice lead up to the treeline. Other than that, very nice. 7</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, one of the better ones I''ve seen so far. The only change I might have made is move just a touch to the right before taking this so that the shadow runs from the left side giving a nice lead up to the treeline. Other than that, very nice. 7', '2008-12-26 18:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152282, 749247, 101117, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a building but from the angle it''s difficult to tell. Could be nice to see just a little more of the subject to give it some context.</td>', 'I assume this is a building but from the angle it''s difficult to tell. Could be nice to see just a little more of the subject to give it some context.', '2008-12-26 18:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152286, 749308, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. For some reason I think it would be better flipped horizontally, though I''m not basing my scoring on that because it''s probably just me being strange!</td>', 'Nice shot. For some reason I think it would be better flipped horizontally, though I''m not basing my scoring on that because it''s probably just me being strange!', '2008-12-26 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152291, 749407, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I don''t actually see any shadows here, just dark colours.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I don''t actually see any shadows here, just dark colours.', '2008-12-26 18:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152295, 748521, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and great colours, love the long straight lines of the shadows.</td>', 'Nice shot and great colours, love the long straight lines of the shadows.', '2008-12-26 18:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152303, 749260, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good shot with an interesting subject. I do find the visible corner of the table distracting, possibly because of the harsh contrast between what is the strongest lit area and the dark background.</td>', 'Good shot with an interesting subject. I do find the visible corner of the table distracting, possibly because of the harsh contrast between what is the strongest lit area and the dark background.', '2008-12-26 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152310, 748783, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. The uneven spacing between the blinds is a little annoying though, don''t know if that was something within your control.</td>', 'Nice colours. The uneven spacing between the blinds is a little annoying though, don''t know if that was something within your control.', '2008-12-26 18:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152314, 749244, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadows to lead into the subject, but you have cropped most of the subject off leaving only the shadows. Could have been nice to see more of what I assume is trees silhouetted against water.</td>', 'Good use of shadows to lead into the subject, but you have cropped most of the subject off leaving only the shadows. Could have been nice to see more of what I assume is trees silhouetted against water.', '2008-12-26 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152315, 749651, 101117, '<td valign="top">Don''t see any shadows here at all</td>', 'Don''t see any shadows here at all', '2008-12-26 18:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152317, 749049, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great picture, reminds me of the marshmallow man in Ghostbusters, though I''m sure that wasn''t your intention!</td>', 'Great picture, reminds me of the marshmallow man in Ghostbusters, though I''m sure that wasn''t your intention!', '2008-12-26 18:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152323, 749594, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice depth and atmosphere. Would have liked to see the top of that foreground pillar though. 7</td>', 'Great shot, nice depth and atmosphere. Would have liked to see the top of that foreground pillar though. 7', '2008-12-26 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152326, 749590, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, almost feels like abstract art. Nice timing with the light, the shadows help the shot a lot.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, almost feels like abstract art. Nice timing with the light, the shadows help the shot a lot.', '2008-12-26 18:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152329, 749486, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like this, it almost looks like the shadows have somehow become inverted .</td>', 'I like this, it almost looks like the shadows have somehow become inverted .', '2008-12-26 18:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152331, 748730, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Might have been good if you brought a little more of the cable / spring into focus.</td>', 'Nice colours. Might have been good if you brought a little more of the cable / spring into focus.', '2008-12-26 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152335, 749338, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the shadows and pillars seem to cut the passageway into little segments.</td>', 'Nice shot, the shadows and pillars seem to cut the passageway into little segments.', '2008-12-26 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152343, 748610, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good subject but there''s some stuff lying in the upper area of the frame that is a bit distracting, could have been better if you cropped it out.</td>', 'Good subject but there''s some stuff lying in the upper area of the frame that is a bit distracting, could have been better if you cropped it out.', '2008-12-26 18:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152350, 749335, 101117, '<td valign="top">There''s a little too much in this shot. The bright yellow flowers in the background grab my attention and it actually took me a couple of seconds to see the insects amongst all the colours.</td>', 'There''s a little too much in this shot. The bright yellow flowers in the background grab my attention and it actually took me a couple of seconds to see the insects amongst all the colours.', '2008-12-26 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152358, 749316, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and interesting subject, though the roses don''t stand out particularly against the similar coloured background.</td>', 'Nice colours and interesting subject, though the roses don''t stand out particularly against the similar coloured background.', '2008-12-26 18:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152369, 749413, 101117, '<td valign="top">Haha, good subject. Particularly like the nature of the gift, should appeal to all us camera folk.</td>', 'Haha, good subject. Particularly like the nature of the gift, should appeal to all us camera folk.', '2008-12-26 18:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152374, 749100, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice peaceful scene, colours are just a touch flat, could have done with a very slight adjustment in curves / levels to bring them out.</td>', 'Nice peaceful scene, colours are just a touch flat, could have done with a very slight adjustment in curves / levels to bring them out.', '2008-12-26 18:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152379, 748679, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shadow, though (and I could just be nit picking here) you have chosen to keep the text clear, so it would better if it was something relevant to the subject, rather than what I assume is a phone directory.</td>', 'Interesting use of shadow, though (and I could just be nit picking here) you have chosen to keep the text clear, so it would better if it was something relevant to the subject, rather than what I assume is a phone directory.', '2008-12-26 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152382, 749116, 101117, '<td valign="top">I actually thought that was a shadow initially, then realised it didn''t match the railing!</td>', 'I actually thought that was a shadow initially, then realised it didn''t match the railing!', '2008-12-26 18:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152384, 748275, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this meets the challenge, don''t feel there''s any distinct shadows that add to the shot.</td>', 'Not sure how this meets the challenge, don''t feel there''s any distinct shadows that add to the shot.', '2008-12-26 18:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152389, 749390, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great vivid colours and I love the touch of the camera, though it took me a while to figure out what it was!</td>', 'Great vivid colours and I love the touch of the camera, though it took me a while to figure out what it was!', '2008-12-26 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152393, 748523, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. It feels like you have a touch of motion blur, but for some reason it adds to the shot for ome rather than distracts from it. Like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice subject. It feels like you have a touch of motion blur, but for some reason it adds to the shot for ome rather than distracts from it. Like this a lot.', '2008-12-26 18:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152397, 749488, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shadows and text!</td>', 'Interesting use of shadows and text!', '2008-12-26 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152401, 749490, 101117, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a really nice shot, but the lower half feels underexposed. I can see some detail there if I turn my brightness up and look at my screen from a funny angle, so there is details there. You could have improved this with a levels / curve adjustment.</td>', 'I think this could be a really nice shot, but the lower half feels underexposed. I can see some detail there if I turn my brightness up and look at my screen from a funny angle, so there is details there. You could have improved this with a levels / curve adjustment.', '2008-12-26 18:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152403, 748971, 101117, '<td valign="top">Don''t really see any shadows here, and while it''s a nice enough shot, it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge to me.</td>', 'Don''t really see any shadows here, and while it''s a nice enough shot, it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge to me.', '2008-12-26 18:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152406, 748481, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good texture and a nicely formed shadow. The subject doesn''t hold a whole lot of interest for me though.</td>', 'Good texture and a nicely formed shadow. The subject doesn''t hold a whole lot of interest for me though.', '2008-12-26 18:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152408, 749543, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, one of the better ones I''ve seen in this challenge. 7</td>', 'Nice shot, one of the better ones I''ve seen in this challenge. 7', '2008-12-26 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152413, 748830, 101117, '<td valign="top">Looks cold and the blue lighting and long shadow adds to that feeling. Nice shot with a good atmosphere.</td>', 'Looks cold and the blue lighting and long shadow adds to that feeling. Nice shot with a good atmosphere.', '2008-12-26 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152425, 749270, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, don''t really see the relevance of the pins locations though. I assume you are referring to conflict zones but you have one located on what would be Spain / Portugal border.</td>', 'Interesting subject, don''t really see the relevance of the pins locations though. I assume you are referring to conflict zones but you have one located on what would be Spain / Portugal border.', '2008-12-26 18:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152429, 748535, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good show and one of the more unusual subjects. Like the shadows here, they add to the shot without actually hiding parts of the subject.</td>', 'Good show and one of the more unusual subjects. Like the shadows here, they add to the shot without actually hiding parts of the subject.', '2008-12-26 18:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152432, 749391, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great colours, but the rocks feel little underexposed. I realise that was probably to preserve the shadows but I think the overall shot would have been better with a bit more texture in the rocks.</td>', 'Great colours, but the rocks feel little underexposed. I realise that was probably to preserve the shadows but I think the overall shot would have been better with a bit more texture in the rocks.', '2008-12-26 18:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152434, 749480, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, well composed. Looks like something straight out of a horror movie.</td>', 'Great shot, well composed. Looks like something straight out of a horror movie.', '2008-12-26 18:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152441, 749378, 101117, '<td valign="top">Love the way the frosted tree is brilliantly lit with the rest in relative darkness. Great shot. 9</td>', 'Love the way the frosted tree is brilliantly lit with the rest in relative darkness. Great shot. 9', '2008-12-26 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152443, 749537, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good shot, though for me the aeroplanes at the bottom are a little distracting, could have been good to crop them off. Otherwise, like this a lot.</td>', 'Good shot, though for me the aeroplanes at the bottom are a little distracting, could have been good to crop them off. Otherwise, like this a lot.', '2008-12-26 18:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152445, 749428, 101117, '<td valign="top">This whole shot feels a little out of focus and I''m not sure about the angle you are taking it from.</td>', 'This whole shot feels a little out of focus and I''m not sure about the angle you are taking it from.', '2008-12-26 18:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152447, 749526, 101117, '<td valign="top">The foreground tree here just feels like it''s in the way and blocking something more interesting.</td>', 'The foreground tree here just feels like it''s in the way and blocking something more interesting.', '2008-12-26 18:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152449, 748856, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice, shot, great textures and I think the B&amp;W works really well here. Well done. 8</td>', 'Very nice, shot, great textures and I think the B&W works really well here. Well done. 8', '2008-12-26 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152453, 748699, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice "vintage" style shot. Could have been good to get it from a bit lower down and get more of the people into the shot.</td>', 'Nice "vintage" style shot. Could have been good to get it from a bit lower down and get more of the people into the shot.', '2008-12-26 18:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152455, 748157, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is really just darkness to me. I know that''s what you''re trying to get it, but I feel there is just too little detail and too much black area.</td>', 'This is really just darkness to me. I know that''s what you''re trying to get it, but I feel there is just too little detail and too much black area.', '2008-12-26 18:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152460, 748069, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very interesting use of shadows, including the large black one at the top right. Makes for a really interesting shot. Love the colours and general subject too. 8</td>', 'Great shot, very interesting use of shadows, including the large black one at the top right. Makes for a really interesting shot. Love the colours and general subject too. 8', '2008-12-26 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152462, 749393, 101117, '<td valign="top">Love the shadows here, looks like you got perfect timing with the light.</td>', 'Love the shadows here, looks like you got perfect timing with the light.', '2008-12-26 19:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152464, 749619, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I find the texture of the background a little distracting though.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I find the texture of the background a little distracting though.', '2008-12-26 19:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152466, 748095, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and really interesting lighting. Looks just like something you would see in a comic book.</td>', 'Nice subject and really interesting lighting. Looks just like something you would see in a comic book.', '2008-12-26 19:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152471, 749525, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and well done on the exposure here, particularly for snow. Might have improved it a bit if the dog was a bit more in the left side of the frame and the shadow towards the middle.</td>', 'I like the subject and well done on the exposure here, particularly for snow. Might have improved it a bit if the dog was a bit more in the left side of the frame and the shadow towards the middle.', '2008-12-26 19:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152473, 749516, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice enough subject, but I don''t actually see any shadows here.</td>', 'Nice enough subject, but I don''t actually see any shadows here.', '2008-12-26 19:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152477, 749441, 101117, '<td valign="top">The only shadow in the whole shot is that of the pram, and it''s cut off the bottom so I have to say this doesn''t have a particular relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'The only shadow in the whole shot is that of the pram, and it''s cut off the bottom so I have to say this doesn''t have a particular relevance to the challenge.', '2008-12-26 19:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152482, 749460, 101117, '<td valign="top">Contrast here is way too high and the whites are super bright to the point where they are just annoying. The shot also isn''t straight, it slopes off to the left. Sorry to sound so critical but these are things that are within your control in PP and are easily corrected.</td>', 'Contrast here is way too high and the whites are super bright to the point where they are just annoying. The shot also isn''t straight, it slopes off to the left. Sorry to sound so critical but these are things that are within your control in PP and are easily corrected.', '2008-12-26 19:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152484, 748618, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, now where did I see this before :) I love the screw as a subject, they make great shots.</td>', 'Nice idea, now where did I see this before :) I love the screw as a subject, they make great shots.', '2008-12-26 19:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152486, 749519, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not sure who''s scaring who there, or is that the point? Great use of shadows, especially the shadow of the spiky hair!</td>', 'Not sure who''s scaring who there, or is that the point? Great use of shadows, especially the shadow of the spiky hair!', '2008-12-26 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152505, 749467, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but there seems to be some grey marks all across the frame which are really distracting.</td>', 'Interesting shot but there seems to be some grey marks all across the frame which are really distracting.', '2008-12-26 19:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152507, 749657, 101117, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this a particularly interesting subject. I think the shadow would have been better in a lower light (as in lower down) to stop it taking on that weird shape across the ledge.</td>', 'I don''t find this a particularly interesting subject. I think the shadow would have been better in a lower light (as in lower down) to stop it taking on that weird shape across the ledge.', '2008-12-26 19:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152513, 748626, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice seasonal subject, good composition.</td>', 'Nice seasonal subject, good composition.', '2008-12-26 19:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152518, 748412, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Not really sure of the relevance between that and the title, but that could just be more.</td>', 'Nice subject. Not really sure of the relevance between that and the title, but that could just be more.', '2008-12-26 19:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152520, 749457, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice mood to this shot, good use of shadows.</td>', 'Nice mood to this shot, good use of shadows.', '2008-12-26 19:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152521, 749455, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good portrait, but not sure if the shadow helps the model here.</td>', 'Good portrait, but not sure if the shadow helps the model here.', '2008-12-26 19:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5152523, 749412, 101117, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t hold too much interest for me, perhaps there''s too much in the frame, cropping it back to just the chair shadows might have helped.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t hold too much interest for me, perhaps there''s too much in the frame, cropping it back to just the chair shadows might have helped.', '2008-12-26 19:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
