(5153586, 749100, 66201, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting with great shadows. I think your image might have been enhanced with a stretching of the brightness/contrast toggle and perhaps a little hue saturation..?</td>', 'Beautiful setting with great shadows. I think your image might have been enhanced with a stretching of the brightness/contrast toggle and perhaps a little hue saturation..?', '2008-12-27 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5153587, 749651, 66201, '<td valign="top">looking like a snow elephant~! Not sure that "Shadows" jump out at me in this though. Some lovely minimalist lines - great simplicity: I wonder how this would have turned out had it been converted to black and white and had the balances of brightness/contrast stretched...?</td>', 'looking like a snow elephant~! Not sure that "Shadows" jump out at me in this though. Some lovely minimalist lines - great simplicity: I wonder how this would have turned out had it been converted to black and white and had the balances of brightness/contrast stretched...?', '2008-12-27 14:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5153592, 748942, 66201, '<td valign="top">What an amazing tree and shadow!! The framing of the window is distracting... Of course I would have loved a front-on view to increase simplicity. I wonder however, having used this same image, and you had cropped the window frame ruthlessly out, so that your tree was not centered, and almost heading for an abstract...what it would have looked like?</td>', 'What an amazing tree and shadow!! The framing of the window is distracting... Of course I would have loved a front-on view to increase simplicity. I wonder however, having used this same image, and you had cropped the window frame ruthlessly out, so that your tree was not centered, and almost heading for an abstract...what it would have looked like?', '2008-12-27 14:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5153595, 748521, 66201, '<td valign="top">An interesting, abstract image...of course I would love to have seen what this looks like converted to black and white and with greater contrast...hmmm?</td>', 'An interesting, abstract image...of course I would love to have seen what this looks like converted to black and white and with greater contrast...hmmm?', '2008-12-27 14:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5153596, 748523, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is great! Reminds me of Henri Cartier-Bresson (and I hope his fans don''t get bent out of shape by this comment). It''s not the type of photo that typically scores well on DPC, but I think it''s an excellent shot.</td>', 'This is great! Reminds me of Henri Cartier-Bresson (and I hope his fans don''t get bent out of shape by this comment). It''s not the type of photo that typically scores well on DPC, but I think it''s an excellent shot.', '2008-12-27 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
