(5154649, 749486, 84656, '<td valign="top">The highlights are a bit blown, and the composition doesn''t quite feel right but the elements of the image are great.  I like the way the shadows lead one into the image and then the pattern is repeated with the actual tombs.  The pattern is repeated again with the trees in the background. The image would probably be better without the two foreground trees. Very well seen, you have produced a fascinating image.</td>', 'The highlights are a bit blown, and the composition doesn''t quite feel right but the elements of the image are great.  I like the way the shadows lead one into the image and then the pattern is repeated with the actual tombs.  The pattern is repeated again with the trees in the background. The image would probably be better without the two foreground trees. Very well seen, you have produced a fascinating image.', '2008-12-28 10:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154650, 748535, 84656, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  Well done and Good luck.</td>', 'Great lighting.  Well done and Good luck.', '2008-12-28 10:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154657, 749393, 84656, '<td valign="top">Would prefer it without the pigeons, they keep drawing my attention.</td>', 'Would prefer it without the pigeons, they keep drawing my attention.', '2008-12-28 10:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154658, 749620, 84656, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the contrast</td>', 'Like the composition and the contrast', '2008-12-28 10:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
