(5156275, 749630, 66201, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of pixelation happening in this image - I think perhaps it is exaggerated by the busy-ness of the leaves/foliage/grass. The shadows have become a very small part of this composition, and if I did not know the challenge topic, I might not have noticed them at all. Yes - there are definitely shadows, but in terms of fulfilling a topic, voters might feel that your image doesn''t "scream" shadows - in other words, a bit subtle. It is a lovely composition and I like the way the main tree fills the bottom left quadrant.</td>', 'There is a lot of pixelation happening in this image - I think perhaps it is exaggerated by the busy-ness of the leaves/foliage/grass. The shadows have become a very small part of this composition, and if I did not know the challenge topic, I might not have noticed them at all. Yes - there are definitely shadows, but in terms of fulfilling a topic, voters might feel that your image doesn''t "scream" shadows - in other words, a bit subtle. It is a lovely composition and I like the way the main tree fills the bottom left quadrant.', '2008-12-29 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
