(5158841, 748679, 102019, '<td valign="top">there were better shots of the same concept in this contest.  This was the first of them that I saw, and to be honest, I didn''t even notice the heart shadow until I went back a second time to look - I wish the shadow shape had been sharper and more clear.  Also -- I didn''t really find the text all that relevant to the photo, i thought the hotel for a honeymoon was a bit of a stretch...  or maybe you''re taking off your ring to go spend the night in a hotel with your mistress? kind of adds an ironic twist to the photo which I don''t think was intended...</td>', 'there were better shots of the same concept in this contest.  This was the first of them that I saw, and to be honest, I didn''t even notice the heart shadow until I went back a second time to look - I wish the shadow shape had been sharper and more clear.  Also -- I didn''t really find the text all that relevant to the photo, i thought the hotel for a honeymoon was a bit of a stretch...  or maybe you''re taking off your ring to go spend the night in a hotel with your mistress? kind of adds an ironic twist to the photo which I don''t think was intended...', '2008-12-30 23:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
