(5159238, 748523, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love this image and I think there is no way it should be down in 56th place. As for the shadow versus silhouette comments, most of the lower half of the image is in shadow! Nowhere in the brief did it say take a photo of a shadow produced by an object which sits in the way of the light cast by a discrete source.<br/> <br/>Thank goodness for <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=82985" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">chromeydome</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-31 08:16:27.</i></td>', 'I love this image and I think there is no way it should be down in 56th place. As for the shadow versus silhouette comments, most of the lower half of the image is in shadow! Nowhere in the brief did it say take a photo of a shadow produced by an object which sits in the way of the light cast by a discrete source. Thank goodness for  chromeydome and  posthumous', '2008-12-31 02:21:55.000000', '2008-12-31 08:16:27.000000', 0),
