(5159302, 749590, 39427, '<td valign="top">Excellent abstract!  Way to take something boring and create a compelling photograph out of it, Congrats on the Ribbon.  Contrast works perfect.</td>', 'Excellent abstract!  Way to take something boring and create a compelling photograph out of it, Congrats on the Ribbon.  Contrast works perfect.', '2008-12-31 03:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5159305, 748868, 28742, '<td valign="top">5.6 is reasonably well. :) The concept is good - only problem I see with the execution is (to my thinking anyway) that the shadow should more closely match the foreground in terms of scope - would be hard to use a bust of santa and convey the idea though, so I think if you got your whole body in the shot and mimicked Santa''s pose, it would have struck a better chord with voters.</td>', '5.6 is reasonably well. :) The concept is good - only problem I see with the execution is (to my thinking anyway) that the shadow should more closely match the foreground in terms of scope - would be hard to use a bust of santa and convey the idea though, so I think if you got your whole body in the shot and mimicked Santa''s pose, it would have struck a better chord with voters.', '2008-12-31 03:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
