(5159695, 748868, 79720, '<td valign="top">1st of all, I didn''t vote, but it would have had a 6 from me. I think it''s a clever set-up, and I like the humorous pose...but there''s some technical issues. The red cast on Santa (which you mentioned), and look at your hand/face skin tones...it <u>totally</u> lacks contrast, like highlight/shadow run amok on the highlights. There''s no detail either there, or on your sweater. And you needed a shave. But 30 out of 125 ain''t too shabby, is it?</td>', '1st of all, I didn''t vote, but it would have had a 6 from me. I think it''s a clever set-up, and I like the humorous pose...but there''s some technical issues. The red cast on Santa (which you mentioned), and look at your hand/face skin tones...it totally lacks contrast, like highlight/shadow run amok on the highlights. There''s no detail either there, or on your sweater. And you needed a shave. But 30 out of 125 ain''t too shabby, is it?', '2008-12-31 09:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5159700, 748868, 54645, '<td valign="top">@Ken and Deb...thanks, actually that helps. That was my intent as it is a fantasy. Although I must admit, I gave my neighbors hell for not having a wooden Santa shaped like me! ;)</td>', '@Ken and Deb...thanks, actually that helps. That was my intent as it is a fantasy. Although I must admit, I gave my neighbors hell for not having a wooden Santa shaped like me! ;)', '2008-12-31 10:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
