(5159729, 749443, 66201, '<td valign="top">Well done! Could be a calendar shot. The colours are so rich. Amazing detail in the clouds - love the wispy bits that are curling outwards - I see too that the whole image is divided naturally into thirds. Very clever ;-)</td>', 'Well done! Could be a calendar shot. The colours are so rich. Amazing detail in the clouds - love the wispy bits that are curling outwards - I see too that the whole image is divided naturally into thirds. Very clever ;-)', '2008-12-31 10:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
