(5161245, 748868, 65405, '<td valign="top">Ok you go have a look at my pics and you will immediately discount anything I say.  So, thats+6 settled.  I don''t know poop about poop about this stuff...for some that is a very good thing..for others not-so-much.  So, neither here nor there I can vote and do.<br/>I liked the shot of you, think that is fab!  but that shadow (not the 5 o''clock)...I didn''t like it so much..it was contrived a little to much.  My eye wasn''t feel''n it (no my eyes don''t really ''feel'' you know what I mean!).<br/>So, if I gave you a lower (I''m totally not a super-bitch and give out nasty numbers) I''m sorry...bottom line it just didn''t tickle my fancy. *shrugs*<br/>But I love your work, love you and your grungy unshaven face!<br/>xox<br/>Happy New Year baby!<br/></td>', 'Ok you go have a look at my pics and you will immediately discount anything I say.  So, thats+6 settled.  I don''t know poop about poop about this stuff...for some that is a very good thing..for others not-so-much.  So, neither here nor there I can vote and do.I liked the shot of you, think that is fab!  but that shadow (not the 5 o''clock)...I didn''t like it so much..it was contrived a little to much.  My eye wasn''t feel''n it (no my eyes don''t really ''feel'' you know what I mean!).So, if I gave you a lower (I''m totally not a super-bitch and give out nasty numbers) I''m sorry...bottom line it just didn''t tickle my fancy. *shrugs*But I love your work, love you and your grungy unshaven face!xoxHappy New Year baby!', '2008-12-31 21:39:15.000000', NULL, 0),
