(5163307, 749203, 101688, '<td valign="top">HAHA thanks for all the comments. i had about 2.5 feet between walls to fit the flash, camera, me, and my hands to make this shot work. and i was essentially shooting blind. most of the time the shadows didnt come out right so it was between this and one other and the framing was better in the other one but the hands were better in this one so i used this one</td>', 'HAHA thanks for all the comments. i had about 2.5 feet between walls to fit the flash, camera, me, and my hands to make this shot work. and i was essentially shooting blind. most of the time the shadows didnt come out right so it was between this and one other and the framing was better in the other one but the hands were better in this one so i used this one', '2009-01-01 16:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
